{
  "$schema": "https://cardz.roderic.dev/designs/schema.json",
  "Name": "My Spider (1 Suit)",
  "Description": "**Goal:** assemble eight complete King-to-Ace runs and move them to the foundations.\n\n- Tableau columns build **down in any suit**. Spider has 1, 2, or 4-suit variations; this table enforces the **1-suit variation** (suits are interchangeable, so any descending run can be moved together).\n- Only **face-up** cards can be picked up; uncovering a face-down card flips it.\n- Any card may start an empty column.\n- When you're stuck, **tap the stock** to deal one card onto every column — allowed only when **no column is empty**.\n- A **complete King-to-Ace run** (all 13 cards) leaves for a foundation **on its own** the moment you finish it — there is nothing to drag.",
  "Decks": [
    {
      "Suits": [
        "Spades"
      ],
      "Count": 8
    }
  ],
  "Depots": [
    {
      "Type": "Stock",
      "FanDirection": "None",
      "Col": 0,
      "Row": 0,
      "Name": "stock",
      "AcceptRule": {
        "RejectsAll": true
      },
      "EjectRule": {
        "Gate": "Locked"
      }
    },
    {
